cactus of doom <cactusofdoom@aol.com> wrote:
>I have a few un-id'd amulets, but no means of id-ing them.

Make sure the amulet is not cursed. Put it on. That will instantly
identify change, restful sleep and strangulation. ESP you can easily
identify if you don't have telepathy from another source. Reflection
will make itself obvious fairly quickly. Magical breathing you can
identify if you really want to by going for a swim. Life saving you may
already have had a monster ID for you. Versus poison will be easy if you
don't have poison resistance. That leaves unchanging, which you may be
able to identify by an attempting polymorph.

There is also a (slightly abusive, IMO) trick to identify an amulet of
ESP. See the top of David Damerell's object ID spoiler for this one.

